s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and unpredictable collisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved vehicle physics and stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energy system tied to speed and movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible arcade-style handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original retro-wave and synthwave soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build up speed, feel the music, and become part of an endless neon race.</strong></p>",
